}

# SILK stereo predictor decode (stereo config 9, frame 0): the packet header reads
# VAD0/LBRR0/VAD1/LBRR1, then silk_stereo_decode_pred → MS predictors (Q13). Bit-exact
# vs a libopus golden (SSPRED dump).
